==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|paper|work}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# A [[clerical]] task or set of tasks involving [[routine]] [[written]] work; [[busy work]]; [[red tape]].
# {{informal}} [[excessive|Excessive]], [[intricate]] or [[meticulous]] [[work]] with [[documents]] in an [[unnecessary]] and [[incidental]] way to more important tasks.

====Synonyms====
* [[administrativia]]
* [[administrivia]]
* [[busy work]]
* [[red tape]]

